<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper C · Learner paper</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/c/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper C</p><h1>Paper C · Learner paper</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper C</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 20 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. What will the woman do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 去车站接人</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 整理客房</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 去买水果</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. When will the family begin dinner?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 晚上六点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 晚上七点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 晚上六点四十</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. How often does the speaker have this meal at Grandma’s home?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 每月两次</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 每周两次</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 每天一次</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. Where can the woman ride on a flat route during her free time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 山边</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 河边</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 学校里面</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Which approach does Xiaolin’s experience support choosing?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 每次都争取骑得最快</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 轻松骑车，不只比速度</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 骑车时一直不许停</div></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. Where will the man wait?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 老菜市场门口</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 邮局里面</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 新市场东门</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. How will they travel to the market?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 坐公交车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 骑自行车</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 走路</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. What should the man do first after leaving the station?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 立即过桥</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 直接走向南门</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 沿河向北走</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. Which service meets the man’s arrival and payment needs?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 市场班车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两种车都一定不能坐</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 公交车</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. What will they do this Sunday?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 照常去外面放风筝</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 先在家做纸风筝</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把活动全部取消不再做</div></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. How many boxes of biscuits will be given as gifts?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三盒</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. Which cup matches the uncle’s stated preference?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 带把手的小杯子</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 带把手的大杯子</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 没有把手的小杯子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. What is the stated price of the packaged gift set?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二十五块</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十八块</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 六块</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. Which gift meets the journey-related requirements?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 围巾</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 玻璃杯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大花瓶</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. What will the woman prepare before the guests arrive?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 重新订晚饭</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 把客厅椅子摆好</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 等男生到家再准备座位</div></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. What change is forecast for the afternoon?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 风会完全停下来</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 会比早上热很多</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 风会明显变大</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. Why are they writing the cards indoors?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 外面正在下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 屋外的活动要到晚上才开始</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 外面的风会吹走纸</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. Which plan fits the water availability during this outing?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 到广场再装水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 到路上商店再买水</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 出门前在家装水</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What did the family do immediately after dinner?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一起分月饼</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 先给姐姐打电话</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 马上去阳台拍照</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. How does Grandma appear to feel after the video call starts?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 很高兴能和哥哥联系</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 完全不想看哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 生气得不肯吃饭</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 25 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. What does the mother ask Xiaozhou to do first?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">给小周的留言<br>客人上午就到，玄关的鞋子已经收好了，水果也洗过了。请你回家后先把餐桌上的课本放进书柜，给客人留出喝茶的地方。不要把书放到阳台，那里下午风大。<br>妈妈</p></div><p class="note">玄关: entrance area</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 把课本放进书柜</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 再洗一次水果</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把课本搬到阳台</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. When does the formal video conversation begin?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">家庭视频安排<br>今晚七点先吃饭，七点半检查手机和网络，八点正式和外地舅舅视频聊天。八点半再给他看客人带来的照片。请不要把设备检查时间当作正式聊天的开始时间。</p></div><p class="note">设备: equipment</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 晚上七点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 晚上八点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 晚上八点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. How long does Xiao’an spend tidying each evening under the current arrangement?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小安的家务记录<br>客人住在我家这几天，我每天晚饭后整理客厅十五分钟。以前妈妈建议我整理半小时，现在家人分工以后，我只要十五分钟就能完成。客人走后会再讨论新的分工，不用每天做同样的事。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十五分钟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 半小时</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一小时</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Which riding period fits Xiaolin’s arrival and both opening windows?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">周日骑行信息<br>公园骑行区上午十点到十一点开放；门口租车处九点半到十点半营业，车可以在十一点归还。小林九点五十分到公园，想当天先租车再进骑行区，上午十一点必须离开。</p></div><p class="note">租: rent</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九点半到十点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十点到十点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十一点到十一点半</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. What does Xiaolin’s choice suggest mattered most on this outing?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林的骑行记录<br>妹妹刚学会骑车，跟不上原来那组快车队。我今天没有跟车队出发，而是陪妹妹慢慢骑，到她想休息的时候就一起停下。朋友问我骑了多远，我先给他看了和妹妹的合影。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 陪家人一起骑车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一定要比朋友骑得远</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 完全不愿意停下来</div></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Where should shoppers go for this week’s market?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">社区市场通知<br>原来在旧车库里的周末市场暂停一周。本周的摊位搬到社区活动室旁边的小院，入口在邮局对面。不要再到旧车库排队，那里本周只接收工作人员的物资。</p></div><p class="note">摊位: market stall</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 旧车库里面</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 邮局营业厅里面</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 社区活动室旁的小院</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. Which transport does the host ask the guest to use from North Station?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">给来访客人的交通说明<br>请从北站坐地铁二号线，到市场站下车。我们会在车站出口接你，行李多也不用走远路。不要买去南站的长途汽车票，南站离我们家很远。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 去南站的长途汽车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 自己骑车过来</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 地铁二号线</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. What is the first step after leaving the station?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">市场绕行说明<br>南门前正在修路。从车站出来，请先走地下通道到街对面，再顺着河边走到小桥。过桥后就是临时市场的北入口。不要在地下通道出口直接向南，那边围起来不能通行。</p></div><p class="note">地下通道: underpass</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 马上向南走</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 先过河上的小桥</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 走地下通道到街对面</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Which route meets the collection-point and cycling requirements?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">市场取货路线<br>甲路线穿过步行街，不准骑车，只能下车推着走，终点是东门。乙路线沿外圈车道直达南门，可以一路骑行。小周的货在南门，他希望不用下车推车就到取货处。</p></div><p class="note">步行街: pedestrian street</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲路线</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两条都直接到南门</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乙路线</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. How will participants now join the seven-o’clock event?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">中秋社区活动更新<br>大风影响了户外布置，原定晚上七点在广场听故事，改为同一时间的视频故事会。大家在家参加，活动链接下午发到报名群，不用到广场，也不用去活动室占座。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 到广场听故事</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 在家参加视频故事会</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 先去活动室占座</div></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. How many greeting cards are on the order?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">礼品取货单<br>茶叶两份，贺卡六张，鲜花三束。六位客人每人收到一张贺卡；茶叶和鲜花另按家庭分。请按单取货，不要因为有三束花就只带三张卡，卡片上的名字已经写好了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三张</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六张</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 两张</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which gift matches Grandma’s stated wish?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">给奶奶选礼物<br>奶奶说自己不缺茶叶，也不想要只有图片的画册。她最想要一本字比较大、能跟着唱的歌曲书。小周记下了这个愿望，准备在亲戚来访前去书店找。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 只有图片的画册</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 茶叶礼盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大字歌曲书</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. Which delivery charge applies to Xiaozhou’s order?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">花店送货单<br>鲜花四十五元。送到学校门口加五元，送到家加八元。小周让店员送到学校，自己放学后带回家，所以这张单总共五十元。不要按送到家的运费付款。</p></div><p class="note">运费: delivery charge</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 八元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 五十元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五元</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. Which shop meets both the booking situation and collection deadline?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">便餐选择<br>今天临时决定请客，没有提前预订，饭菜必须六点半前取到。甲店六点可取，但必须前一天订。乙店今天订，六点二十可取。丙店不用预订，但最早七点取。三家都有现做的便餐。</p></div><p class="note">预订: book in advance</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲店</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 乙店</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 丙店</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. What will Xiaolin prepare for the visitor’s revised plan?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">家庭消息<br>叔叔的车票从明天改到今晚，来不及留下吃晚饭。小林下午在家，妈妈请他把饭菜装进饭盒，六点交给叔叔带走。客房不用铺床了，叔叔今天不住下。小林答应先准备饭盒。</p></div><p class="note">客房: guest room</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 先给客房铺床</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 装好可以带走的饭菜</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 等待明天再准备饭菜</div></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. According to the latest forecast shown, what is expected this afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">预报更新<br>昨晚的消息说今天下午有大风。今早九点的新预报改为下午风弱，不下雨。负责人提醒小组以九点发布的预报为准，后续若再有变化会另发通知，先不要转发昨晚的旧消息。</p></div><p class="note">转发: forward a message</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 风弱，不下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 仍有昨晚说的大风</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一定会下大雨</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. Why is the group not proceeding with today’s ride?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">骑行小组通知<br>今天的河边骑行取消，原因是预报有大风，负责人决定不按原计划组织。报名人数足够，老师也有空，自行车检查正常。请大家等新的日期通知，不要自己按旧时间到河边集合。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 预报有大风</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 报名的人太少</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 自行车没有检查好</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which option meets both requirements on the card?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">骑行物品卡<br>本次要求带普通白水，装在能盖紧的瓶子里。甲瓶装白水，有能拧紧的盖。乙杯也是白水，但没有盖。丙瓶有盖，里面却是果汁。小周要按物品卡选一份带走。</p></div><p class="note">拧紧: screw tight</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲瓶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 乙杯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 丙瓶</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What follows attaching the family photo to the card?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">中秋家庭贺卡步骤<br>先把全家合影贴在卡片中间，再请每位家人写一句话。大家都写好以后，把卡放进信封，第二天寄给远方的叔叔。没有写齐以前不要封口，免得漏掉谁的祝福。</p></div><p class="note">信封: envelope</p><p class="note">祝福: good wishes</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 马上封好信封</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 请每位家人写一句话</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 当天直接寄出</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. What does Xiaolin’s behaviour suggest about the gathering?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林的中秋记录<br>今年亲戚从外地赶来，我买菜做饭忙了一个下午，确实很累。吃饭时看到大家终于坐在同一张桌旁，我忍不住笑了。晚上把合影存好，第二天又拿出来看，还发给了没能来的姐姐。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 他很珍惜这次团聚</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 他完全不愿意留下照片</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 他只记得自己累，没有开心过</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 20 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 20 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to changed shopping and dinner plans</h2><p>Reply to Xiaozhou in Chinese. Say whether you can collect the gift from the flower shop after six and whether dinner should be at home or at a restaurant near the market. Give a reason for your plan. Suggest another workable arrangement or ask one relevant question. You may invent details. About 40-60 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林：客人改到六点到站，还带着行李。我去接站，花店的礼物六点以后才能取。你能帮忙取吗？晚饭在家吃还是在市场旁的餐馆吃？我们重新安排一下吧。<br>小周</p></div><ul><li>Say whether you can collect the gift after six.</li><li>Choose dinner at home or a restaurant, or explain a feasible alternative.</li><li>Give a reason related to the plan.</li><li>Suggest an alternative arrangement or ask a relevant question.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Describe a family festival gathering</h2><p>Use the fictional card to describe last year’s family Mid-Autumn gathering. Include when and where, at least two actions in a consistent sequence, and a feeling or reason. Connected simple Chinese sentences are enough. About 80-120 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">时间：去年中秋晚上<br>地点：家里<br>饭前：全家一起摆桌子<br>晚饭时：接通视频，和外地姐姐聊天<br>饭后：分月饼、看全家照片<br>结束前：给姐姐拍一段祝福视频<br>感受：自己选择并说明</p></div><ul><li>Identify last year’s Mid-Autumn evening.</li><li>Identify the family home.</li><li>Describe one action on the card.</li><li>Describe a second action in a consistent sequence.</li><li>Give a feeling or reason.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Plan purchases before visitors arrive</h2><p>A family member is planning shopping before guests arrive. Answer four fixed recorded prompts in Chinese. Each prompt plays twice, then allow 15 seconds to prepare and up to 25 seconds to record. Use real or invented details. All four responses form one task out of eight; the prompts do not adapt to your answer.</p><p>State a shopping need, choose something for the guests, explain the choice, and handle an earlier market closing time.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Compare two community activities</h2><p>Recommend one activity to a classmate who is free only on Sunday morning, wants to make a greeting card for a visiting grandparent and has no craft materials at home. Compare the options, state a choice, give two reasons using the cards and describe a short plan. If your choice changes the original goal, explain that change. Prepare for 60 seconds and speak for up to 90 seconds.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">社区周日活动<br>甲：手工教室贺卡课，上午九点到十点，二十元含全部材料；老师可以帮助写字，做好的卡可以带回家。<br>乙：阅览室故事会，上午九点到十点，免费；可以借一本故事书回家，没有手工材料，也不安排制作贺卡。<br>同学：只有上午有空，想亲手做贺卡送给来访的外婆，家中没有材料，两项活动的费用都能接受。</p></div><ul><li>Compare one or more features of both activities.</li><li>Choose an activity.</li><li>Give a first reason supported by the cards.</li><li>Give a second distinct reason supported by the cards.</li><li>Describe a feasible plan and explain any change to the original goal.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section></main></body></html>